1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,450
Open your mouth wide.

2
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:03,933
Now say "Mmm."

3
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:04,880
Can't?

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,100
M is a hum...

5
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,267
that comes out your NOSE.

6
00:00:08,299 --> 00:00:10,280
Shut your lips and hum.

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,767
Feel your nose buzz?

8
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,753
Now open up...

9
00:00:12,753 --> 00:00:13,980
and the hum spills out

10
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,967
your MOUTH instead.

11
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,142
That's why you can't

12
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:18,930
answer your dentist.

13
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:19,970
Ventriloquists

14
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,720
can't say M either.

15
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,567
They fake it with an N.

16
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,800
Now say "mama"...

17
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,707
without moving your lips.

